1
00:02:21,849 --> 00:02:25,205
Command station, this is ST-321.
Code clearance blue.

2
00:02:25,329 --> 00:02:28,127
We're starting our approach.
Deactivate the security shield.

3
00:02:28,889 --> 00:02:30,845
The security deflector shield
will be deactivated...

4
00:02:30,969 --> 00:02:33,164
when we have confirmation
of your code transmission.

5
00:02:33,289 --> 00:02:34,404
Stand by.

6
00:02:35,849 --> 00:02:37,646
You are clear to proceed.

7
00:02:37,769 --> 00:02:39,964
We're starting our approach.

8
00:03:05,809 --> 00:03:08,846
Inform the commander
that Lord Vader's shuttle has arrived.

9
00:03:08,969 --> 00:03:10,004
Sir.

10
00:03:45,369 --> 00:03:48,247
Lord Vader, this is an unexpected
pleasure. We're honoured.

11
00:03:48,369 --> 00:03:50,564
You may dispense
with the pleasantries, Commander.

12
00:03:50,689 --> 00:03:53,078
I'm here to put you back on schedule.

13
00:03:53,209 --> 00:03:56,121
I assure you, Lord Vader,
my men are working as fast as they can.

14
00:03:56,249 --> 00:03:59,525
Perhaps I can find
new ways to motivate them.

15
00:04:00,809 --> 00:04:03,642
I tell you this station
will be operational as planned.

16
00:04:04,409 --> 00:04:09,483
The emperor does not share your
optimistic appraisal of the situation.

17
00:04:09,609 --> 00:04:12,681
But he asks the impossible.
I need more men.

18
00:04:12,809 --> 00:04:15,801
Then perhaps you can tell him
when he arrives.

19
00:04:17,009 --> 00:04:20,365
- The emperor's coming here?
- That is correct, Commander...

20
00:04:20,489 --> 00:04:25,040
<i>and he is most displeased with
your apparent lack of progress.</i>

21
00:04:25,809 --> 00:04:27,527
We shall double our efforts.

22
00:04:27,649 --> 00:04:30,800
I hope so, Commander, for your sake.

23
00:04:30,929 --> 00:04:34,638
The emperor is not
as forgiving as I am.

24
00:04:51,849 --> 00:04:54,204
Of course I'm worried.
And you should be too.

25
00:04:54,329 --> 00:04:57,958
Lando Calrissian and poor Chewbacca
never returned from this awful place.

26
00:05:00,289 --> 00:05:02,200
Don't be so sure.

27
00:05:02,329 --> 00:05:05,480
If I told you half the things
I've heard about this Jabba the Hutt...

28
00:05:05,609 --> 00:05:07,406
<i>you'd probably short-circuit.</i>

29
00:05:19,409 --> 00:05:21,365
R2, are you sure
this is the right place?

30
00:05:26,289 --> 00:05:28,325
I'd better knock, I suppose.

31
00:05:30,089 --> 00:05:33,843
There doesn't seem to be anyone here.
Let's go back and tell Master Luke.

32
00:05:37,289 --> 00:05:39,120
Goodness gracious me!

33
00:06:01,489 --> 00:06:03,719
I don't think
they're going to let us in, R2.

34
00:06:05,489 --> 00:06:07,320
We'd better go.

35
00:06:16,009 --> 00:06:17,567
R2, wait.

36
00:06:19,409 --> 00:06:21,286
Oh, dear. R2.

37
00:06:21,409 --> 00:06:24,560
R2, I really don't think
we should rush into all this.

38
00:06:25,569 --> 00:06:27,525
Oh, R2!

39
00:06:27,649 --> 00:06:29,162
R2, wait for me!

40
00:06:36,049 --> 00:06:39,439
Just you deliver Master Luke's message
and get us out of here.

41
00:06:39,569 --> 00:06:41,446
Oh, my!

42
00:06:45,249 --> 00:06:46,318
Oh, no.

43
00:06:51,209 --> 00:06:52,608
Oh, my.

44
00:06:57,409 --> 00:07:00,128
We bring a message
to your master,Jabba the Hutt.

45
00:07:03,689 --> 00:07:05,805
And a gift.

46
00:07:05,929 --> 00:07:07,203
What gift?

47
00:07:23,049 --> 00:07:28,043
He says that our instructions
are to give it only to Jabba himself.

48
00:07:37,529 --> 00:07:41,078
I'm terribly sorry. I'm afraid he's ever
so stubborn about these sort of things.

49
00:07:43,409 --> 00:07:46,685
R2, I have a bad feeling about this.

50
00:08:20,089 --> 00:08:21,841
Good morning.

51
00:08:26,929 --> 00:08:29,045
The message, R2.
The message.

52
00:08:38,649 --> 00:08:40,287
<i>Greetings, Exalted One.</i>

53
00:08:40,409 --> 00:08:42,604
<i>Allow me to introduce myself.</i>

54
00:08:42,729 --> 00:08:46,438
<i>I am Luke Skywalker,
Jedi knight and friend to Captain Solo.</i>

55
00:08:47,209 --> 00:08:49,769
<i>I know that you are powerful,
mighty Jabba...</i>

56
00:08:49,889 --> 00:08:53,404
<i>and that your anger with Solo
must be equally powerful.</i>

57
00:08:53,529 --> 00:08:57,158
<i>I seek an audience with Your Greatness
to bargain for Solo's life.</i>

58
00:09:00,809 --> 00:09:03,323
<i>With your wisdom, I'm sure
we can work out an arrangement...</i>

59
00:09:03,449 --> 00:09:05,087
<i>which will be mutually beneficial...</i>

60
00:09:05,209 --> 00:09:07,769
<i>and enable us to avoid
any unpleasant confrontation.</i>

61
00:09:09,729 --> 00:09:12,846
<i>As a token of my goodwill,
I present to you a gift-</i>

62
00:09:12,969 --> 00:09:14,641
<i>these two droids.</i>

63
00:09:14,769 --> 00:09:16,566
What did he say?

64
00:09:16,689 --> 00:09:20,079
<i>Both are hard-working
and will serve you well.</i>

65
00:09:20,209 --> 00:09:23,804
This can't be.
R2, you're playing the wrong message.

66
00:09:30,129 --> 00:09:31,847
He's no Jedi.

67
00:09:34,369 --> 00:09:38,044
There will be no bargain.

68
00:09:38,169 --> 00:09:40,285
We're doomed.

69
00:09:40,409 --> 00:09:47,087
I will not give up
my favourite decoration.

70
00:09:48,529 --> 00:09:51,805
I like Captain Solo where he is.

71
00:09:53,449 --> 00:09:55,440
R2, look. Captain Solo.

72
00:09:55,569 --> 00:09:58,003
And he's still frozen in carbonite.

73
00:10:10,609 --> 00:10:12,964
What could possibly
have come over Master Luke?

74
00:10:13,969 --> 00:10:17,757
Was it something I did? He never
expressed any unhappiness with my work.

75
00:10:18,769 --> 00:10:20,327
How horrid!

76
00:10:47,849 --> 00:10:50,283
Good. New acquisitions.

77
00:10:50,409 --> 00:10:52,923
You are a protocol droid,
are you not?

78
00:10:53,049 --> 00:10:54,880
I am C-3PO-

79
00:10:55,009 --> 00:10:56,681
Yes or no will do.

80
00:10:56,809 --> 00:10:58,242
Well, yes.

81
00:10:58,369 --> 00:11:00,758
How many languages do you speak?

82
00:11:00,889 --> 00:11:04,359
I am fluent in over six million forms
of communication and can readily-

83
00:11:04,489 --> 00:11:07,003
Splendid. We have been
without an interpreter...

84
00:11:07,129 --> 00:11:10,326
since our master got angry
with our last protocol droid...

85
00:11:10,449 --> 00:11:12,167
and disintegrated him.

86
00:11:12,289 --> 00:11:13,802
Disintegrated?

87
00:11:18,569 --> 00:11:22,164
Guard, this protocol droid
might be useful.

88
00:11:22,289 --> 00:11:24,359
Fit him with a restraining bolt...

89
00:11:24,489 --> 00:11:27,686
and take him back up to
His Excellency's main audience chamber.

90
00:11:27,809 --> 00:11:30,164
R2, don't leave me!

91
00:11:35,169 --> 00:11:37,160
You're a feisty little one...

92
00:11:37,289 --> 00:11:39,644
but you'll soon learn some respect.

93
00:11:39,769 --> 00:11:42,920
I have need for you on
the master's sail barge...

94
00:11:43,049 --> 00:11:45,643
and I think you'll fill in nicely.

95
00:12:13,089 --> 00:12:16,320
Ah! Do that again!

96
00:14:05,049 --> 00:14:09,088
I have come for the bounty
on this Wookiee.

97
00:14:10,089 --> 00:14:11,363
Oh, no. Chewbacca.

98
00:14:14,889 --> 00:14:19,326
At last we have the mighty Chewbacca.

99
00:14:24,889 --> 00:14:27,562
Yes, I am here,
Your Worshipfulness.

100
00:14:28,689 --> 00:14:29,917
Yes?

101
00:14:38,809 --> 00:14:40,686
The illustrious Jabba
bids you welcome...

102
00:14:40,809 --> 00:14:43,277
and will gladly pay you
the reward of 25,000.

103
00:14:44,289 --> 00:14:46,245
I want 50,000. No less.

104
00:14:47,009 --> 00:14:48,920
"50,000. No less. "

105
00:15:01,449 --> 00:15:02,962
What did I say?

106
00:15:09,089 --> 00:15:11,603
The mighty Jabba asks why
he must pay 50,000.

107
00:15:15,489 --> 00:15:17,639
Because he's holding
a thermal detonator.

108
00:15:28,529 --> 00:15:32,841
This bounty hunter
is my kind of scum...

109
00:15:33,769 --> 00:15:36,442
fearless and inventive.

110
00:15:45,489 --> 00:15:48,208
Jabba offers the sum of 35...

111
00:15:48,329 --> 00:15:50,399
and I do suggest you take it.

112
00:15:55,729 --> 00:15:57,287
He agrees!

113
00:18:40,489 --> 00:18:42,798
Just relax for a moment.

114
00:18:42,929 --> 00:18:45,443
You're free of the carbonite.

115
00:18:47,449 --> 00:18:50,759
You have hibernation sickness.

116
00:18:50,889 --> 00:18:55,167
- I can't see.
- Your eyesight will return in time.

117
00:18:55,289 --> 00:18:58,440
- Where am I?
- Jabba's palace.

118
00:19:01,609 --> 00:19:03,167
Who are you?

119
00:19:07,969 --> 00:19:10,324
- Someone who loves you.
- Leia.

120
00:19:13,769 --> 00:19:15,600
I gotta get you out of here.

121
00:19:18,209 --> 00:19:19,881
What's that?

122
00:19:22,529 --> 00:19:24,326
I know that laugh.

123
00:19:30,049 --> 00:19:31,277
Hey,Jabba.

124
00:19:31,409 --> 00:19:34,128
Look,Jabba, I was just
on my way to pay you back.

125
00:19:34,249 --> 00:19:37,002
I got a little sidetracked.
It's not my fault.

126
00:19:37,129 --> 00:19:40,678
It's too late for that, Solo.

127
00:19:40,809 --> 00:19:45,325
You may have been a good smuggler...

128
00:19:45,449 --> 00:19:48,759
but now you're Bantha fodder.

129
00:19:53,249 --> 00:19:54,159
Look-

130
00:19:55,409 --> 00:19:57,365
Take him away.

131
00:19:57,489 --> 00:19:59,161
Jabba, I'll pay you triple.

132
00:19:59,289 --> 00:20:01,678
You're throwing away a fortune here.
Don't be a fool.

133
00:20:04,489 --> 00:20:06,559
Bring her to me.

134
00:20:10,449 --> 00:20:12,405
We have powerful friends.

135
00:20:12,529 --> 00:20:14,679
You're gonna regret this.

136
00:20:16,489 --> 00:20:18,286
I'm sure.

137
00:20:22,169 --> 00:20:23,921
I can't bear to watch.

138
00:20:37,929 --> 00:20:39,328
Chewie?

139
00:20:41,049 --> 00:20:42,926
Chewie, is that you?

140
00:20:44,809 --> 00:20:47,277
Wait a minute.
I can't see, pal.

141
00:20:48,329 --> 00:20:50,160
What's going on?

142
00:20:52,609 --> 00:20:54,122
Luke? Luke's crazy.

143
00:20:54,249 --> 00:20:57,639
He can't even take care of himself,
much less rescue anybody.

144
00:20:59,449 --> 00:21:01,246
AJedi knight?

145
00:21:02,089 --> 00:21:05,718
I'm out of it for a little while,
everybody gets delusions of grandeur.

146
00:21:09,049 --> 00:21:10,846
I'm all right, pal.

147
00:21:12,569 --> 00:21:14,127
I'm all right.

148
00:22:05,809 --> 00:22:07,800
I must speak with Jabba.

149
00:22:12,849 --> 00:22:14,680
No bargain.

150
00:22:14,809 --> 00:22:17,164
You will take me to Jabba now.

151
00:22:21,449 --> 00:22:23,167
You serve your master well.

152
00:22:25,049 --> 00:22:26,880
And you will be rewarded.

153
00:22:35,409 --> 00:22:38,526
At last! Master Luke's
come to rescue me.

154
00:22:38,649 --> 00:22:40,002
Master.

155
00:22:42,009 --> 00:22:44,967
Luke Skywalker,Jedi knight.

156
00:22:45,089 --> 00:22:49,162
I told you not to admit him.

157
00:22:49,289 --> 00:22:51,007
I must be allowed to speak.

158
00:22:51,129 --> 00:22:53,768
He must be allowed to speak.

159
00:22:54,569 --> 00:22:57,402
You weak-minded fool!

160
00:22:59,369 --> 00:23:03,521
He's using an old Jedi mind trick.

161
00:23:03,649 --> 00:23:06,959
You will bring Captain Solo
and the Wookiee to me.

162
00:23:12,689 --> 00:23:17,638
Your mind powers
will not work on me, boy.

163
00:23:17,769 --> 00:23:19,839
Nevertheless...

164
00:23:19,969 --> 00:23:22,802
I'm taking Captain Solo
and his friends.

165
00:23:22,929 --> 00:23:26,604
You can either profit by this
or be destroyed.

166
00:23:26,729 --> 00:23:29,562
It's your choice, but I warn you
not to underestimate my powers.

167
00:23:31,729 --> 00:23:33,720
Master Luke, you're standing on-

168
00:23:33,849 --> 00:23:38,240
There will be no bargain, young Jedi.

169
00:23:39,409 --> 00:23:42,799
I shall enjoy watching you die.

170
00:24:12,609 --> 00:24:15,077
Oh, no! The rancor!

171
00:26:55,569 --> 00:26:59,084
Bring me Solo and the Wookiee.

172
00:26:59,209 --> 00:27:03,248
They will all suffer for this outrage.

173
00:27:17,529 --> 00:27:18,484
Han.

174
00:27:21,889 --> 00:27:24,961
- Are you all right?
- Fine. Together again, huh?

175
00:27:25,089 --> 00:27:27,398
- Wouldn't miss it.
- How are we doin'?

176
00:27:27,529 --> 00:27:30,089
- Same as always.
- That bad, huh?

177
00:27:30,209 --> 00:27:32,598
- Where's Leia?
- I'm here.

178
00:27:36,089 --> 00:27:37,488
Oh, dear.

179
00:27:38,329 --> 00:27:41,287
His High Exaltedness,
the great Jabba the Hutt...

180
00:27:41,409 --> 00:27:44,321
has decreed that you are
to be terminated immediately.

181
00:27:44,449 --> 00:27:46,007
Good. I hate long waits.

182
00:27:48,329 --> 00:27:50,797
You will therefore be taken
to the Dune Sea...

183
00:27:50,929 --> 00:27:53,159
and cast into the Pit of Carkoon...

184
00:27:53,289 --> 00:27:55,484
nesting place
of the all-powerful Sarlacc.

185
00:27:55,609 --> 00:27:56,758
Doesn't sound so bad.

186
00:27:56,889 --> 00:28:00,598
In his belly, you will find a new
definition of pain and suffering...

187
00:28:00,729 --> 00:28:03,687
as you are slowly digested
over 1,000 years.

188
00:28:05,129 --> 00:28:07,165
On second thought,
let's pass on that.

189
00:28:07,289 --> 00:28:08,847
You should have bargained,Jabba.

190
00:28:12,529 --> 00:28:14,884
<i>That's the last mistake
you'll ever make.</i>

191
00:29:04,329 --> 00:29:05,967
I think my eyes are getting better.

192
00:29:06,089 --> 00:29:09,081
Instead of a big dark blur,
I see a big light blur.

193
00:29:09,929 --> 00:29:12,966
There's nothing to see.
I used to live here, you know.

194
00:29:13,089 --> 00:29:15,808
<i>You're gonna die here,
you know. Convenient.</i>

195
00:29:15,929 --> 00:29:18,124
Just stick close to Chewie and Lando.

196
00:29:18,249 --> 00:29:20,479
I've taken care of everything.

197
00:29:21,329 --> 00:29:22,557
Great.

198
00:29:26,529 --> 00:29:32,604
Soon you will learn to appreciate me.

199
00:29:34,449 --> 00:29:35,677
I'm terribly sorry.

200
00:29:35,809 --> 00:29:38,607
R2, what are you doing here?

201
00:29:38,729 --> 00:29:41,641
I can see you're serving drinks,
but this place is dangerous.

202
00:29:41,769 --> 00:29:44,602
They're going to execute Master Luke,
and if we're not careful, us too.

203
00:29:47,369 --> 00:29:49,200
I wish I had your confidence.

204
00:30:11,569 --> 00:30:13,685
Victims of the almighty Sarlacc...

205
00:30:13,809 --> 00:30:16,801
His Excellency hopes
that you will die honourably.

206
00:30:18,609 --> 00:30:21,077
But should any of you
wish to beg for mercy...

207
00:30:21,209 --> 00:30:25,043
the great Jabba the Hutt
will now listen to your pleas.

208
00:30:29,089 --> 00:30:34,209
3PO, you tell that slimy piece
of worm-ridden filth...

209
00:30:34,329 --> 00:30:36,843
he'll get no such pleasure from us!

210
00:30:36,969 --> 00:30:38,687
Right?

211
00:30:41,849 --> 00:30:43,840
This is your last chance.

212
00:30:43,969 --> 00:30:45,960
Free us or die.

213
00:30:50,249 --> 00:30:52,922
Move him into position.

214
00:31:16,129 --> 00:31:18,279
Put him in.

215
00:31:41,729 --> 00:31:43,128
Easy, Chewie.

216
00:31:52,689 --> 00:31:54,088
Help!

217
00:32:00,569 --> 00:32:02,685
Chewie, you're hit?
Where is it?

218
00:32:08,529 --> 00:32:09,928
Han, Chewie!

219
00:32:10,049 --> 00:32:11,038
Lando.

220
00:32:18,889 --> 00:32:20,083
Boba Fett?

221
00:32:22,049 --> 00:32:23,402
Boba Fett? Where?

222
00:32:55,249 --> 00:32:57,160
- Lando, grab it!
- Lower it!

223
00:32:57,289 --> 00:32:58,608
I'm trying!

224
00:33:19,849 --> 00:33:22,158
Grab me, Chewie.
Grab it!

225
00:33:34,369 --> 00:33:36,519
Grab it. Almost.
You almost got it.

226
00:33:45,529 --> 00:33:46,803
Gently, now.

227
00:33:46,929 --> 00:33:48,885
Easy. Hold me, Chewie.

228
00:34:00,169 --> 00:34:01,648
Chewie, give me the gun.

229
00:34:01,769 --> 00:34:04,647
- Don't move, Lando.
- Wait! I thought you were blind!

230
00:34:04,769 --> 00:34:06,680
I can see a lot better.
Don't move.

231
00:34:06,809 --> 00:34:08,288
A little higher!

232
00:34:11,329 --> 00:34:13,240
Chewie, pull us up.

233
00:34:14,329 --> 00:34:15,808
Up, Chewie. Up.

234
00:34:17,569 --> 00:34:19,082
We gotta get out of here.

235
00:34:19,769 --> 00:34:21,487
Not my eyes! R2, help!

236
00:34:22,569 --> 00:34:23,445
Quickly, R2!

237
00:34:24,929 --> 00:34:25,918
Beast!

238
00:34:31,089 --> 00:34:32,841
Get the gun!

239
00:34:32,969 --> 00:34:34,163
Point it at the deck.

240
00:34:39,489 --> 00:34:40,968
Point it at the deck!

241
00:34:44,609 --> 00:34:47,043
R2, where are we going?
I couldn't possibly-

242
00:34:52,049 --> 00:34:53,448
Come on.

243
00:35:01,169 --> 00:35:03,524
- Let's go. Don't forget the droids.
- We're on our way.

244
00:35:41,449 --> 00:35:43,121
I'll meet you back at the fleet.

245
00:35:43,249 --> 00:35:45,763
<i>Hurry. The Alliance
should be assembled by now.</i>

246
00:35:45,889 --> 00:35:48,449
<i>- I will.
- Luke, thanks.</i>

247
00:35:48,569 --> 00:35:51,686
<i>Thanks for coming after me.
Now I owe you one.</i>

248
00:35:57,169 --> 00:35:59,478
That's right, R2.
We're going to the Dagobah system.

249
00:36:05,649 --> 00:36:07,799
I have a promise to keep...

250
00:36:07,929 --> 00:36:09,806
to an old friend.

251
00:36:58,889 --> 00:37:00,288
Rise, my friend.

252
00:37:06,729 --> 00:37:09,846
The Death Star will be
completed on schedule.

253
00:37:10,609 --> 00:37:12,998
You've done well, Lord Vader.

254
00:37:13,129 --> 00:37:18,726
<i>Now I sense you wish to continue
your search for young Skywalker.</i>

255
00:37:21,089 --> 00:37:22,442
Yes, my master.

256
00:37:23,209 --> 00:37:25,723
Patience, my friend.

257
00:37:25,849 --> 00:37:29,046
In time, he will seek you out.

258
00:37:29,169 --> 00:37:33,401
<i>When he does,
you must bring him before me.</i>

259
00:37:33,529 --> 00:37:35,724
He has grown strong.

260
00:37:35,849 --> 00:37:41,287
Only together can we turn him
to the dark side of the Force.

261
00:37:41,409 --> 00:37:43,081
As you wish.

262
00:37:44,649 --> 00:37:48,483
Everything is proceeding
as I have foreseen.

263
00:38:13,849 --> 00:38:15,601
That face you make-

264
00:38:16,649 --> 00:38:19,083
Look I so old to young eyes?

265
00:38:19,209 --> 00:38:20,881
No, of course not.

266
00:38:22,249 --> 00:38:23,807
I do.

267
00:38:26,809 --> 00:38:28,686
Yes, I do.

268
00:38:30,769 --> 00:38:33,158
Sick have I become.

269
00:38:33,289 --> 00:38:35,166
Old and weak.

270
00:38:39,649 --> 00:38:41,480
When 900 years old you reach...

271
00:38:41,609 --> 00:38:43,361
look as good you will not.

272
00:38:49,969 --> 00:38:52,005
Soon will I rest.

273
00:38:52,129 --> 00:38:55,121
Yes. Forever sleep.

274
00:38:56,689 --> 00:38:58,247
Earned it I have.

275
00:38:58,369 --> 00:39:00,929
Master Yoda, you can't die.

276
00:39:02,449 --> 00:39:05,009
Strong am I with the Force...

277
00:39:05,129 --> 00:39:07,006
but not that strong.

278
00:39:09,609 --> 00:39:14,524
Twilight is upon me,
and soon night must fall.

279
00:39:18,329 --> 00:39:19,887
That is the way of things...

280
00:39:22,009 --> 00:39:24,045
the way of the Force.

281
00:39:25,889 --> 00:39:27,686
But I need your help.

282
00:39:27,809 --> 00:39:30,846
I've come back
to complete the training.

283
00:39:30,969 --> 00:39:33,005
No more training do you require.

284
00:39:33,129 --> 00:39:36,121
Already know you
that which you need.

285
00:39:39,129 --> 00:39:41,279
Then I am a Jedi.

286
00:39:47,929 --> 00:39:49,521
Not yet.

287
00:39:49,649 --> 00:39:51,560
One thing remains-

288
00:39:52,569 --> 00:39:56,801
Vader. You must confront Vader.

289
00:39:57,569 --> 00:40:01,528
Then- only then-
a Jedi will you be.

290
00:40:03,209 --> 00:40:05,245
And confront him you will.

291
00:40:09,729 --> 00:40:11,128
Master Yoda...

292
00:40:14,729 --> 00:40:17,038
is Darth Vader my father?

293
00:40:20,049 --> 00:40:22,438
Rest I need.

294
00:40:22,569 --> 00:40:23,922
Yes.

295
00:40:24,049 --> 00:40:25,607
Rest.

296
00:40:27,369 --> 00:40:29,325
Yoda, I must know.

297
00:40:33,489 --> 00:40:35,559
Your father he is.

298
00:40:41,609 --> 00:40:44,043
Told you, did he?

299
00:40:45,729 --> 00:40:47,048
Yes.

300
00:40:48,809 --> 00:40:51,004
Unexpected this is.

301
00:40:52,929 --> 00:40:54,282
And unfortunate.

302
00:40:56,009 --> 00:40:57,965
Unfortunate that I know the truth?

303
00:40:58,089 --> 00:40:59,317
No.

304
00:41:02,409 --> 00:41:06,163
<i>Unfortunate that
you rushed to face him...</i>

305
00:41:06,289 --> 00:41:08,723
that incomplete
was your training...

306
00:41:09,769 --> 00:41:13,125
that not ready
for the burden were you.

307
00:41:15,049 --> 00:41:16,607
I'm sorry.

308
00:41:17,769 --> 00:41:23,048
Remember, a Jedi's strength
flows from the Force.

309
00:41:27,889 --> 00:41:29,561
But beware.

310
00:41:29,689 --> 00:41:33,079
Anger, fear, aggression...

311
00:41:33,209 --> 00:41:35,723
the dark side are they.

312
00:41:36,449 --> 00:41:39,998
Once you start down the dark path...

313
00:41:40,129 --> 00:41:43,724
forever will it dominate your destiny.

314
00:41:50,689 --> 00:41:52,361
Do not-

315
00:41:55,329 --> 00:41:59,641
Do not underestimate
the powers of the emperor...

316
00:42:00,689 --> 00:42:03,999
or suffer your father's fate you will.

317
00:42:08,289 --> 00:42:10,245
When gone am I...

318
00:42:11,089 --> 00:42:14,047
the last of the Jedi will you be.

319
00:42:18,369 --> 00:42:22,282
The Force runs strong in your family.

320
00:42:24,689 --> 00:42:28,125
Pass on what you have learned.

321
00:42:37,569 --> 00:42:39,287
There is...

322
00:42:40,409 --> 00:42:42,001
another...

323
00:42:46,009 --> 00:42:50,161
Skywalker.

324
00:43:48,489 --> 00:43:50,286
I can't do it, R2.

325
00:43:54,009 --> 00:43:56,318
I can't go on alone.

326
00:43:56,449 --> 00:43:58,519
<i>Yoda will always be with you.</i>

327
00:43:59,569 --> 00:44:00,718
Obi-Wan.

328
00:44:08,449 --> 00:44:10,007
Why didn't you tell me?

329
00:44:10,129 --> 00:44:13,838
You told me Vader betrayed
and murdered my father.

330
00:44:13,969 --> 00:44:19,248
Your father was seduced
by the dark side of the Force.

331
00:44:19,369 --> 00:44:23,123
He ceased to be Anakin Skywalker
and became Darth Vader.

332
00:44:23,249 --> 00:44:24,682
When that happened...

333
00:44:24,809 --> 00:44:27,846
<i>the good man who was
your father was destroyed.</i>

334
00:44:28,849 --> 00:44:31,158
So what I told you was true...

335
00:44:31,289 --> 00:44:33,041
from a certain point of view.

336
00:44:33,169 --> 00:44:35,524
A certain point of view?

337
00:44:35,649 --> 00:44:39,358
Luke, you're going to find
that many of the truths we cling to...

338
00:44:39,489 --> 00:44:42,287
depend greatly
on our own point of view.

339
00:44:43,049 --> 00:44:45,643
Anakin was a good friend.

340
00:44:46,569 --> 00:44:48,082
When I first knew him...

341
00:44:48,209 --> 00:44:50,279
<i>your father was already a great pilot...</i>

342
00:44:50,409 --> 00:44:53,879
but I was amazed how strongly
the Force was with him.

343
00:44:54,009 --> 00:44:57,797
I took it upon myself
to train him as a Jedi.

344
00:44:57,929 --> 00:45:01,683
I thought that I could instruct him
just as well as Yoda.

345
00:45:01,809 --> 00:45:03,037
I was wrong.

346
00:45:03,969 --> 00:45:05,766
There is still good in him.

347
00:45:05,889 --> 00:45:08,528
He's more machine now than man...

348
00:45:08,649 --> 00:45:10,526
twisted and evil.

349
00:45:12,209 --> 00:45:14,325
I can't do it, Ben.

350
00:45:14,449 --> 00:45:16,280
You cannot escape your destiny.

351
00:45:16,409 --> 00:45:19,526
You must face Darth Vader again.

352
00:45:19,649 --> 00:45:22,322
I can't kill my own father.

353
00:45:25,449 --> 00:45:28,407
Then the emperor has already won.

354
00:45:29,409 --> 00:45:31,559
You were our only hope.

355
00:45:32,809 --> 00:45:34,845
Yoda spoke of another.

356
00:45:36,809 --> 00:45:39,277
The other he spoke of
is your twin sister.

357
00:45:40,169 --> 00:45:42,046
But I have no sister.

358
00:45:43,129 --> 00:45:44,960
To protect you both
from the emperor...

359
00:45:45,089 --> 00:45:48,525
<i>you were hidden from your father
when you were born.</i>

360
00:45:48,649 --> 00:45:51,004
The emperor knew, as I did...

361
00:45:51,129 --> 00:45:54,678
if Anakin were to have any offspring...

362
00:45:54,809 --> 00:45:57,243
they would be a threat to him.

363
00:45:57,369 --> 00:46:02,443
That is the reason why your sister
remains safely anonymous.

364
00:46:04,889 --> 00:46:08,677
- Leia is my sister.
- Your insight serves you well.

365
00:46:09,929 --> 00:46:12,682
Bury your feelings deep down, Luke.

366
00:46:12,809 --> 00:46:15,084
They do you credit...

367
00:46:15,209 --> 00:46:18,167
but they could be made
to serve the emperor.

368
00:46:39,729 --> 00:46:42,289
Look at you. A general, huh?

369
00:46:42,409 --> 00:46:45,367
Someone must have told them about
my manoeuvre at the Battle of Tanaab.

370
00:46:45,489 --> 00:46:48,242
Don't look at me, pal.
I just said you were a fair pilot.

371
00:46:48,369 --> 00:46:51,202
I didn't know they were looking for
somebody to lead this crazy attack.

372
00:46:51,329 --> 00:46:53,365
I'm surprised they didn't
ask you to do it.

373
00:46:54,209 --> 00:46:56,086
Who says they didn't?
But I ain't crazy.

374
00:46:56,209 --> 00:46:57,927
You're the respectable one, remember?

375
00:47:05,929 --> 00:47:08,762
The emperor's made a critical error
and the time for our attack has come.

376
00:47:09,529 --> 00:47:13,238
The data brought to us by the Bothan
spies pinpoint the exact location...

377
00:47:13,369 --> 00:47:15,405
of the emperor's new battle station.

378
00:47:15,529 --> 00:47:17,247
We also know
that the weapon systems...

379
00:47:17,369 --> 00:47:19,519
of this Death Star
are not yet operational.

380
00:47:19,649 --> 00:47:22,482
With the imperial fleet
spread throughout the galaxy...

381
00:47:22,609 --> 00:47:24,042
in a vain effort to engage us...

382
00:47:24,169 --> 00:47:25,966
it is relatively unprotected.

383
00:47:26,089 --> 00:47:28,045
But most important of all...

384
00:47:28,929 --> 00:47:30,760
we've learned that
the emperor himself...

385
00:47:30,889 --> 00:47:32,925
is personally overseeing
the final stages...

386
00:47:33,049 --> 00:47:35,404
of the construction
of this Death Star.

387
00:47:36,249 --> 00:47:40,527
Many Bothans died
to bring us this information.

388
00:47:42,969 --> 00:47:44,243
Admiral Ackbar, please.

389
00:47:44,369 --> 00:47:49,284
You can see here the Death Star
orbiting the forest moon of Endor.

390
00:47:49,409 --> 00:47:54,642
Although the weapon systems on this
Death Star are not yet operational...

391
00:47:54,769 --> 00:47:58,125
the Death Star does have
a strong defence mechanism.

392
00:47:59,369 --> 00:48:01,564
It is protected by an energy shield...

393
00:48:01,689 --> 00:48:05,159
which is generated
from the nearby forest moon of Endor.

394
00:48:10,569 --> 00:48:14,164
The shield must be deactivated
if any attack is to be attempted.

395
00:48:15,529 --> 00:48:19,283
Once the shield is down,
our cruisers will create a perimeter...

396
00:48:19,409 --> 00:48:22,207
while the fighters
fly into the superstructure...

397
00:48:22,329 --> 00:48:25,162
and attempt to knock out
the main reactor.

398
00:48:27,929 --> 00:48:30,807
General Calrissian has volunteered
to lead the fighter attack.

399
00:48:30,929 --> 00:48:32,157
Good luck.

400
00:48:33,729 --> 00:48:35,606
You're gonna need it.

401
00:48:35,729 --> 00:48:37,367
General Madine.

402
00:48:38,369 --> 00:48:41,167
We have stolen a small imperial shuttle.

403
00:48:41,289 --> 00:48:45,328
Disguised as a cargo ship
and using a secret imperial code...

404
00:48:45,449 --> 00:48:50,045
a strike team will land on the moon
and deactivate the shield generator.

405
00:48:50,169 --> 00:48:51,363
Sounds dangerous.

406
00:48:51,489 --> 00:48:53,684
Wonder who they found
to pull that off.

407
00:48:53,809 --> 00:48:56,687
General Solo,
is your strike team assembled?

408
00:48:57,449 --> 00:49:00,566
My team's ready. I don't have
a command crew for the shuttle.

409
00:49:01,689 --> 00:49:03,680
It's gonna be rough.
I didn't wanna speak for you.

410
00:49:06,049 --> 00:49:09,837
- That's one.
- General, count me in.

411
00:49:09,969 --> 00:49:11,800
I'm with you too.

412
00:49:17,449 --> 00:49:20,088
- What is it?
- Ask me again sometime.

413
00:49:21,089 --> 00:49:23,683
Hi, Han, Chewie.

414
00:49:24,769 --> 00:49:27,124
"Exciting" is hardly the word
I would choose.

415
00:49:42,089 --> 00:49:45,001
Look, I want you to take her.

416
00:49:45,129 --> 00:49:46,608
I mean it. Take her.

417
00:49:46,729 --> 00:49:50,005
You need all the help you can get.
She's the fastest ship in the fleet.

418
00:49:50,129 --> 00:49:52,359
All right, old buddy.

419
00:49:52,489 --> 00:49:54,400
I know what she means to you.

420
00:49:54,529 --> 00:49:58,078
I'll take good care of her.
She won't get a scratch.

421
00:49:59,329 --> 00:50:00,682
All right?

422
00:50:00,809 --> 00:50:02,037
Right.

423
00:50:08,649 --> 00:50:11,117
I got your promise.
Not a scratch.

424
00:50:11,249 --> 00:50:13,319
Would you get going, you pirate?

425
00:50:15,009 --> 00:50:16,124
Good luck.

426
00:50:16,249 --> 00:50:17,682
You too.

427
00:50:26,449 --> 00:50:28,326
- Got her warmed?
- Yeah, she's coming up.

428
00:50:30,889 --> 00:50:34,359
I don't think the Empire had Wookiees
in mind when they designed her, Chewie.

429
00:50:44,249 --> 00:50:46,126
Hey, you awake?

430
00:50:46,249 --> 00:50:49,559
Yeah. I just got a funny feeling,
like I'm not gonna see her again.

431
00:50:51,609 --> 00:50:53,884
Come on, General. Let's move.

432
00:50:54,009 --> 00:50:57,206
Right. Chewie, let's see
what this piece of junk can do.

433
00:50:57,329 --> 00:50:59,445
- Ready, everybody?
- All set.

434
00:51:01,889 --> 00:51:03,607
Here we go again.

435
00:51:14,169 --> 00:51:16,000
All right, hang on.

436
00:51:31,649 --> 00:51:34,038
What is thy bidding, my master?

437
00:51:35,049 --> 00:51:38,280
Send the fleet
to the far side of Endor.

438
00:51:41,169 --> 00:51:45,560
There it will stay until called for.

439
00:51:46,889 --> 00:51:50,768
What of the reports of the rebel fleet
massing near Sullust?

440
00:51:50,889 --> 00:51:52,800
It is of no concern.

441
00:51:53,569 --> 00:51:57,642
Soon the rebellion will be crushed
and young Skywalker will be one of us.

442
00:51:57,769 --> 00:51:59,487
Your work here is finished, my friend.

443
00:51:59,609 --> 00:52:02,169
Go out to the command ship
and await my orders.

444
00:52:02,289 --> 00:52:04,120
Yes, my master.

445
00:52:19,209 --> 00:52:22,121
If they don't go for this, we're gonna
have to get out pretty quick.

446
00:52:24,289 --> 00:52:26,849
<i>We have you on our screen now.
Please identify.</i>

447
00:52:28,369 --> 00:52:31,998
<i>Shuttle Tydirium requesting
deactivation of the deflector shield.</i>

448
00:52:37,449 --> 00:52:41,328
<i>Shuttle Tydirium, transmit
the clearance code for shield passage.</i>

449
00:52:42,689 --> 00:52:44,042
Transmission commencing.

450
00:52:44,169 --> 00:52:47,047
Now we find out if that code
is worth the price we paid.

451
00:52:48,129 --> 00:52:50,199
It'll work. It'll work.

452
00:52:51,529 --> 00:52:53,599
Vader's on that ship.

453
00:52:53,729 --> 00:52:55,481
Don't get jittery, Luke.

454
00:52:55,609 --> 00:52:57,725
There are a lot of command ships.

455
00:52:58,769 --> 00:53:02,205
Keep your distance, Chewie, but don't
look like you're keeping your distance.

456
00:53:03,409 --> 00:53:05,764
I don't know. Fly casual.

457
00:53:10,809 --> 00:53:12,606
Where is that shuttle going?

458
00:53:13,449 --> 00:53:15,644
<i>Shuttle Tydirium,
what is your cargo and destination?</i>

459
00:53:17,569 --> 00:53:19,525
<i>Parts and technical crew
for the forest moon.</i>

460
00:53:21,649 --> 00:53:24,163
Do they have a code clearance?

461
00:53:24,929 --> 00:53:27,079
It's an older code, sir,
but it checks out.

462
00:53:27,209 --> 00:53:29,086
I was about to clear them.

463
00:53:33,729 --> 00:53:35,879
I'm endangering the mission.
I shouldn't have come.

464
00:53:36,009 --> 00:53:38,204
It's your imagination, kid.

465
00:53:38,329 --> 00:53:40,968
Come on. Let's keep
a little optimism here.

466
00:53:48,769 --> 00:53:50,168
Shall I hold them?

467
00:53:51,209 --> 00:53:53,962
No. Leave them to me.

468
00:53:54,089 --> 00:53:56,284
I will deal with them myself.

469
00:53:57,129 --> 00:53:59,245
As you wish, my lord. Carry on.

470
00:54:01,049 --> 00:54:02,846
They're not going for it, Chewie.

471
00:54:06,889 --> 00:54:08,527
<i>Shuttle Tydirium...</i>

472
00:54:08,649 --> 00:54:10,924
<i>deactivation of the shield
will commence immediately.</i>

473
00:54:11,049 --> 00:54:13,244
<i>Follow your present course.</i>

474
00:54:13,369 --> 00:54:15,758
Okay. I told you
it was gonna work.

475
00:54:15,889 --> 00:54:17,004
No problem.

476
00:54:49,049 --> 00:54:51,005
I told you it was dangerous here.

477
00:55:05,809 --> 00:55:09,119
- Should we try and go around?
- It'll take time.

478
00:55:09,249 --> 00:55:12,127
This whole party will be
for nothing if they see us.

479
00:55:14,849 --> 00:55:17,044
Chewie and I will take care of this.
You stay here.

480
00:55:17,169 --> 00:55:19,729
Quietly. There might be
more of them out there.

481
00:55:19,849 --> 00:55:21,168
Hey...

482
00:55:21,289 --> 00:55:22,517
it's me.

483
00:55:47,089 --> 00:55:49,000
Go for help! Go!

484
00:55:49,129 --> 00:55:50,562
Great. Come on!

485
00:56:05,489 --> 00:56:07,366
Over there! Two more of them.

486
00:56:08,369 --> 00:56:10,564
I see them. Wait. Leia!

487
00:56:14,289 --> 00:56:15,688
Hey, wait!

488
00:56:21,729 --> 00:56:24,084
Quick, jam their comlink.
Centre switch.

489
00:56:35,249 --> 00:56:36,762
Move closer.

490
00:56:39,129 --> 00:56:40,528
Get alongside that one.

491
00:57:20,249 --> 00:57:22,285
Keep on that one.
I'll take these two.

492
00:59:30,729 --> 00:59:32,401
General Solo, somebody's coming.

493
00:59:45,209 --> 00:59:46,278
Where's Leia?

494
00:59:47,129 --> 00:59:49,438
- She didn't come back?
- I thought she was with you.

495
00:59:49,569 --> 00:59:51,958
We got separated.
We better go look for her.

496
00:59:52,089 --> 00:59:55,001
Take the squad ahead. We'll meet
at the shield generator at 0300.

497
00:59:55,129 --> 00:59:57,085
Come on, R2.
We'll need your scanners.

498
00:59:58,289 --> 01:00:00,803
Don't worry, Master Luke.
We know what to do.

499
01:00:02,249 --> 01:00:04,285
And you said it was pretty here.

500
01:00:26,129 --> 01:00:27,926
Cut it out.

501
01:00:44,089 --> 01:00:46,080
I'm not gonna hurt you.

502
01:00:53,809 --> 01:00:56,369
Well, looks like I'm stuck here.

503
01:00:58,289 --> 01:01:00,484
Trouble is, I don't know where here is.

504
01:01:01,489 --> 01:01:03,366
Maybe you can help me.

505
01:01:04,569 --> 01:01:06,207
Come on. Sit down.

506
01:01:08,169 --> 01:01:10,125
I promise I won't hurt you.
Now come here.

507
01:01:11,809 --> 01:01:14,198
All right.
You want something to eat?

508
01:01:20,689 --> 01:01:22,088
That's right.

509
01:01:26,809 --> 01:01:28,447
Come on.

510
01:01:47,849 --> 01:01:49,168
Look. It's a hat.

511
01:01:49,289 --> 01:01:51,166
It's not gonna hurt you. Look.

512
01:01:57,769 --> 01:01:59,885
You're a jittery little thing,
aren't you?

513
01:02:04,969 --> 01:02:06,448
What is it?

514
01:02:44,449 --> 01:02:45,677
Freeze!

515
01:02:45,809 --> 01:02:47,925
Come on. Get up.

516
01:02:52,169 --> 01:02:54,842
- Get your ride. Take her back to base.
- Yes, sir.

517
01:02:59,449 --> 01:03:00,564
What the-

518
01:03:16,929 --> 01:03:19,397
Come on.
Let's get out of here.

519
01:03:59,689 --> 01:04:02,442
I told you to remain
on the command ship.

520
01:04:04,089 --> 01:04:08,640
A small rebel force has penetrated
the shield and landed on Endor.

521
01:04:10,169 --> 01:04:11,807
Yes, I know.

522
01:04:13,289 --> 01:04:15,405
My son is with them.

523
01:04:17,009 --> 01:04:21,446
- Are you sure?
- I have felt him, my master.

524
01:04:22,849 --> 01:04:25,238
Strange that I have not.

525
01:04:26,769 --> 01:04:31,763
I wonder if your feelings
on this matter are clear, Lord Vader.

526
01:04:31,889 --> 01:04:34,528
They are clear, my master.

527
01:04:34,649 --> 01:04:38,722
Then you must go to
the sanctuary moon and wait for him.

528
01:04:38,849 --> 01:04:41,727
He will come to me?

529
01:04:43,889 --> 01:04:46,119
I have foreseen it.

530
01:04:46,249 --> 01:04:50,128
His compassion for you
will be his undoing.

531
01:04:50,249 --> 01:04:54,003
He will come to you,
and then you will bring him before me.

532
01:04:54,769 --> 01:04:56,248
As you wish.

533
01:05:16,929 --> 01:05:18,282
Master Luke.

534
01:05:21,849 --> 01:05:24,488
There's two more
wrecked speeders back there.

535
01:05:24,609 --> 01:05:26,440
And I found this.

536
01:05:27,889 --> 01:05:32,087
I'm afraid that R2's sensors
can find no trace of Princess Leia.

537
01:05:34,409 --> 01:05:35,967
I hope she's all right.

538
01:05:40,729 --> 01:05:41,798
What, Chewie?

539
01:05:44,369 --> 01:05:46,121
What, Chewie?

540
01:05:59,209 --> 01:06:02,440
I don't get it.
It's just a dead animal.

541
01:06:03,249 --> 01:06:05,046
Chewie, wait! Don't!

542
01:06:09,409 --> 01:06:10,808
Nice work.

543
01:06:12,529 --> 01:06:14,281
Great, Chewie.

544
01:06:14,409 --> 01:06:16,400
Great. Always thinking
with your stomach.

545
01:06:16,529 --> 01:06:19,566
Take it easy. Let's just figure
a way to get out of this thing.

546
01:06:19,689 --> 01:06:21,327
Han, can you reach my lightsabre?

547
01:06:21,449 --> 01:06:22,848
Yeah. Sure.

548
01:06:29,609 --> 01:06:32,043
R2, I'm not sure
that's such a good idea.

549
01:06:32,169 --> 01:06:34,080
It's a very long drop!

550
01:07:15,249 --> 01:07:18,047
Hey. Point that thing
someplace else.

551
01:07:22,409 --> 01:07:23,478
Hey!

552
01:07:23,609 --> 01:07:25,964
Han, don't. It'll be all right.

553
01:07:31,969 --> 01:07:34,324
Chewie, give them your crossbow.

554
01:07:36,329 --> 01:07:37,887
Oh, my head.

555
01:07:41,969 --> 01:07:43,687
Oh, my goodness.

556
01:08:14,209 --> 01:08:16,040
Do you understand
anything they're saying?

557
01:08:16,169 --> 01:08:17,522
Oh, yes, Master Luke.

558
01:08:17,649 --> 01:08:20,322
Remember that I am fluent
in over six million forms-

559
01:08:20,449 --> 01:08:22,007
What are you telling them?

560
01:08:23,169 --> 01:08:25,160
"Hello," I think.

561
01:08:25,289 --> 01:08:28,201
I could be mistaken-
they're using a very primitive dialect-

562
01:08:28,329 --> 01:08:31,719
but I do believe they think
I am some sort of god.

563
01:08:35,849 --> 01:08:40,161
Why don't you use your divine
influence and get us out of this?

564
01:08:40,289 --> 01:08:43,042
I beg your pardon, General Solo,
but that just wouldn't be proper.

565
01:08:44,009 --> 01:08:45,328
Proper?

566
01:08:45,449 --> 01:08:47,963
It's against my programming
to impersonate a deity.

567
01:08:48,089 --> 01:08:49,283
Why, you-

568
01:08:57,169 --> 01:08:58,602
My mistake.

569
01:09:00,249 --> 01:09:02,126
He's an old friend of mine.

570
01:09:28,169 --> 01:09:29,488
Hey.

571
01:09:45,969 --> 01:09:48,324
I have a really bad feeling about this.

572
01:10:08,489 --> 01:10:10,002
What did he say?

573
01:10:10,129 --> 01:10:12,359
I'm rather embarrassed,
General Solo...

574
01:10:12,489 --> 01:10:15,845
but it appears you are to be the main
course at a banquet in my honour.

575
01:10:32,649 --> 01:10:34,924
Your Royal Highness.

576
01:10:35,049 --> 01:10:36,721
These are my friends.

577
01:10:39,689 --> 01:10:43,728
3PO, tell them
they must be set free.

578
01:11:00,809 --> 01:11:03,846
Somehow I got the feeling
that didn't help us very much.

579
01:11:03,969 --> 01:11:07,723
3PO, tell them
if they don't do as you wish...

580
01:11:07,849 --> 01:11:09,726
<i>you'll become angry
and use your magic.</i>

581
01:11:09,849 --> 01:11:12,124
But, Master Luke, what magic?
I couldn't possibly-

582
01:11:12,249 --> 01:11:13,728
Tell them.

583
01:11:29,009 --> 01:11:31,000
You see, Master Luke?
They didn't believe me...

584
01:11:31,129 --> 01:11:32,642
just as I said they wouldn't.

585
01:11:32,769 --> 01:11:33,997
Wait.

586
01:11:42,289 --> 01:11:44,086
What's happening?

587
01:11:49,289 --> 01:11:50,927
Put me down!
Help!

588
01:11:51,049 --> 01:11:52,528
Somebody!

589
01:11:52,649 --> 01:11:53,923
Somebody help!

590
01:11:54,049 --> 01:11:56,643
Master Luke! R2, quickly!

591
01:12:27,089 --> 01:12:28,408
Thank goodness.

592
01:12:40,249 --> 01:12:41,841
Thanks, 3PO.

593
01:12:43,049 --> 01:12:44,926
I never knew I had it in me.

594
01:12:52,209 --> 01:12:53,608
...Tatooine...

595
01:12:54,969 --> 01:12:57,278
Princess Leia... R2.

596
01:12:59,369 --> 01:13:00,768
...Darth Vader!

597
01:13:03,769 --> 01:13:05,441
...Death Star.

598
01:13:08,329 --> 01:13:10,479
...Jedi... Obi-Wan Kenobi.

599
01:13:15,849 --> 01:13:17,646
Yes, R2, I was just coming to that.

600
01:13:20,969 --> 01:13:21,924
Master Luke...

601
01:13:28,329 --> 01:13:31,799
<i>...Millennium Falcon... Cloud City.</i>

602
01:13:34,369 --> 01:13:35,404
...Vader!

603
01:13:36,409 --> 01:13:37,603
Han Solo...

604
01:13:39,689 --> 01:13:41,088
...carbon.

605
01:13:42,609 --> 01:13:43,803
...Sarlacc.

606
01:14:04,569 --> 01:14:07,288
- What's going on?
- I don't know.

607
01:14:20,489 --> 01:14:23,049
Wonderful. We are now
a part of the tribe.

608
01:14:24,409 --> 01:14:26,206
Just what I always wanted.

609
01:14:37,529 --> 01:14:39,724
Short help's better than
no help at all, Chewie.

610
01:14:45,129 --> 01:14:48,201
The scouts will show us the quickest
way to the shield generator.

611
01:14:48,329 --> 01:14:50,206
Good. How far is it?

612
01:14:50,329 --> 01:14:51,887
Ask him.

613
01:14:53,049 --> 01:14:55,085
We need some fresh supplies too.

614
01:14:55,209 --> 01:14:57,040
Try and get our weapons back.

615
01:14:58,489 --> 01:15:00,605
Hurry up.
I haven't got all day.

616
01:15:03,009 --> 01:15:04,806
Luke, what's wrong?

617
01:15:06,649 --> 01:15:09,959
<i>Leia, do you remember
your mother-</i>

618
01:15:10,089 --> 01:15:12,045
<i>your real mother?</i>

619
01:15:12,169 --> 01:15:15,525
Just a little bit.
She died when I was very young.

620
01:15:15,649 --> 01:15:17,480
What do you remember?

621
01:15:17,609 --> 01:15:20,077
Just images really. Feelings.

622
01:15:20,209 --> 01:15:21,722
Tell me.

623
01:15:23,369 --> 01:15:26,281
She was... very beautiful.

624
01:15:26,409 --> 01:15:28,923
Kind... but sad.

625
01:15:31,009 --> 01:15:33,682
Why are you asking me this?

626
01:15:33,809 --> 01:15:36,164
I have no memory of my mother.

627
01:15:37,169 --> 01:15:39,080
I never knew her.

628
01:15:40,809 --> 01:15:42,879
Luke, tell me.
What's troubling you?

629
01:15:47,609 --> 01:15:51,238
Vader is here.
Now. On this moon.

630
01:15:52,809 --> 01:15:54,447
How do you know?

631
01:15:54,569 --> 01:15:56,400
I felt his presence.

632
01:15:57,409 --> 01:16:00,526
He's come for me.
He can feel when I'm near.

633
01:16:00,649 --> 01:16:02,446
That's why I have to go.

634
01:16:02,569 --> 01:16:05,879
As long as I stay, I'm endangering
the group and our mission here.

635
01:16:06,889 --> 01:16:09,722
- I have to face him.
- Why?

636
01:16:14,529 --> 01:16:16,326
He's my father.

637
01:16:20,209 --> 01:16:21,688
Your father?

638
01:16:22,929 --> 01:16:26,763
There's more. It won't be easy
for you to hear it, but you must.

639
01:16:26,889 --> 01:16:29,608
<i>If I don't make it back,
you're the only hope for the Alliance.</i>

640
01:16:29,729 --> 01:16:31,162
Don't talk that way.

641
01:16:31,289 --> 01:16:35,601
You have a power I don't understand
and could never have.

642
01:16:35,729 --> 01:16:37,640
You're wrong, Leia.

643
01:16:37,769 --> 01:16:39,521
You have that power too.

644
01:16:39,649 --> 01:16:42,846
In time, you'll learn
to use it as I have.

645
01:16:47,289 --> 01:16:49,439
The Force is strong in my family.

646
01:16:50,929 --> 01:16:52,760
My father has it.

647
01:16:54,129 --> 01:16:55,926
I have it.

648
01:16:56,049 --> 01:16:57,323
And...

649
01:16:58,569 --> 01:17:00,844
my sister has it.

650
01:17:06,889 --> 01:17:09,881
Yes. It's you, Leia.

651
01:17:14,929 --> 01:17:16,487
I know.

652
01:17:19,209 --> 01:17:20,767
Somehow...

653
01:17:22,409 --> 01:17:23,922
I've always known.

654
01:17:24,049 --> 01:17:25,926
Then you know
why I have to face him.

655
01:17:27,969 --> 01:17:30,278
Luke, run away.
Far away.

656
01:17:30,409 --> 01:17:33,606
If he can feel your presence,
then leave this place.

657
01:17:33,729 --> 01:17:36,846
- I wish I could go with you.
- No, you don't.

658
01:17:36,969 --> 01:17:38,846
You've always been strong.

659
01:17:40,089 --> 01:17:42,284
But why must you confront him?

660
01:17:42,409 --> 01:17:45,958
Because there is good in him.
I've felt it.

661
01:17:46,089 --> 01:17:48,000
He won't turn me over
to the emperor.

662
01:17:48,129 --> 01:17:51,121
I can save him. I can turn him
back to the good side.

663
01:17:52,489 --> 01:17:54,207
I have to try.

664
01:18:11,969 --> 01:18:13,800
Hey, what's going on?

665
01:18:15,529 --> 01:18:18,680
Nothing. I just wanna
be alone for a little while.

666
01:18:20,009 --> 01:18:21,567
Nothing?

667
01:18:23,289 --> 01:18:25,120
Tell me.
What's going on?

668
01:18:30,089 --> 01:18:32,159
I can't tell you.

669
01:18:33,729 --> 01:18:36,243
Could you tell Luke?
Is that who you could tell?

670
01:18:53,369 --> 01:18:54,927
I'm sorry.

671
01:18:58,489 --> 01:19:00,127
Hold me.

672
01:19:51,249 --> 01:19:53,046
This is the rebel that surrendered.

673
01:19:53,169 --> 01:19:55,967
Although he denies it,
I believe there may be more of them...

674
01:19:56,089 --> 01:19:58,683
and I request permission
to conduct a further search of the area.

675
01:19:59,729 --> 01:20:02,323
He was armed only with this.

676
01:20:04,249 --> 01:20:05,887
Good work, Commander.

677
01:20:06,009 --> 01:20:07,840
Leave us.

678
01:20:07,969 --> 01:20:11,484
Conduct your search
and bring his companions to me.

679
01:20:12,889 --> 01:20:14,561
Yes, my lord.

680
01:20:16,329 --> 01:20:18,365
The emperor has been expecting you.

681
01:20:19,689 --> 01:20:21,042
I know, Father.

682
01:20:22,489 --> 01:20:24,719
So, you have accepted the truth.

683
01:20:25,849 --> 01:20:29,205
I've accepted the truth that you were
once Anakin Skywalker, my father.

684
01:20:29,329 --> 01:20:32,401
That name no longer
has any meaning for me.

685
01:20:33,169 --> 01:20:35,808
It is the name of your true self.
You've only forgotten.

686
01:20:36,569 --> 01:20:38,127
I know there is good in you.

687
01:20:38,249 --> 01:20:40,763
The emperor hasn't
driven it from you fully.

688
01:20:44,569 --> 01:20:46,685
<i>That was why
you couldn't destroy me.</i>

689
01:20:47,689 --> 01:20:50,123
That's why you won't bring me
to your emperor now.

690
01:20:57,089 --> 01:21:00,001
I see you have constructed
a new lightsabre.

691
01:21:03,489 --> 01:21:06,322
Your skills are complete.

692
01:21:11,329 --> 01:21:15,720
Indeed you are powerful,
as the emperor has foreseen.

693
01:21:20,489 --> 01:21:22,161
Come with me.

694
01:21:24,169 --> 01:21:26,922
Obi-Wan once thought as you do.

695
01:21:28,169 --> 01:21:32,765
You don't know the power
of the dark side.

696
01:21:32,889 --> 01:21:35,528
I must obey my master.

697
01:21:36,569 --> 01:21:39,845
I will not turn,
and you'll be forced to kill me.

698
01:21:41,169 --> 01:21:43,637
If that is your destiny.

699
01:21:43,769 --> 01:21:47,398
Search your feelings, Father.
You can't do this.

700
01:21:47,529 --> 01:21:50,043
I feel the conflict within you.
Let go of your hate.

701
01:21:51,249 --> 01:21:54,525
It is too late for me, son.

702
01:21:57,609 --> 01:22:01,761
The emperor will show you
the true nature of the Force.

703
01:22:01,889 --> 01:22:05,359
He is your master now.

704
01:22:09,249 --> 01:22:11,558
Then my father is truly dead.

705
01:22:52,809 --> 01:22:54,640
The main entrance
to the control bunker...

706
01:22:54,769 --> 01:22:56,680
is on the far side
of that landing platform.

707
01:22:57,529 --> 01:23:00,999
- This isn't gonna be easy.
- Don't worry.

708
01:23:01,129 --> 01:23:04,121
Chewie and me got into a lot of places
more heavily guarded than this.

709
01:23:12,129 --> 01:23:13,687
What's he saying?

710
01:23:13,809 --> 01:23:17,006
He says there's a secret entrance
on the other side of the ridge.

711
01:23:35,449 --> 01:23:38,680
Admiral, we're in position.
All fighters accounted for.

712
01:23:39,529 --> 01:23:41,406
Proceed with the countdown.

713
01:23:42,569 --> 01:23:44,924
All groups assume attack coordinates.

714
01:23:48,169 --> 01:23:50,046
Don't worry.
My friend's down there.

715
01:23:50,169 --> 01:23:52,603
He'll have that shield down on time.

716
01:23:55,449 --> 01:23:57,838
Or this'll be
the shortest offensive of all time.

717
01:23:59,729 --> 01:24:03,278
All craft, prepare to jump
into hyperspace on my mark.

718
01:24:03,409 --> 01:24:05,286
All right. Stand by.

719
01:24:24,089 --> 01:24:26,125
Back door, huh? Good idea.

720
01:24:34,169 --> 01:24:37,002
It's only a few guards.
This shouldn't be too much trouble.

721
01:24:41,969 --> 01:24:44,688
It only takes one to sound the alarm.

722
01:24:44,809 --> 01:24:47,198
Then we'll do it real quiet-like.

723
01:24:47,329 --> 01:24:49,718
- Oh, my. Princess Leia.
- Quiet.

724
01:24:51,009 --> 01:24:52,727
I'm afraid our furry companion...

725
01:24:52,849 --> 01:24:54,885
has gone and done something
rather rash.

726
01:25:00,169 --> 01:25:02,046
There goes our surprise attack.

727
01:25:09,049 --> 01:25:11,199
Look, over there! Stop him!

728
01:25:22,609 --> 01:25:25,521
Not bad for a little furball.
There's only one left.

729
01:25:25,649 --> 01:25:28,004
You stay here.
We'll take care of this.

730
01:25:30,049 --> 01:25:32,165
I have decided that we shall stay here.

731
01:26:00,809 --> 01:26:01,764
Hey!

732
01:27:03,289 --> 01:27:05,962
Welcome, young Skywalker.

733
01:27:06,089 --> 01:27:08,319
I have been expecting you.

734
01:27:09,329 --> 01:27:11,206
You'll no longer need those.

735
01:27:16,449 --> 01:27:18,246
Guards, leave us.

736
01:27:25,369 --> 01:27:28,679
I'm looking forward
to completing your training.

737
01:27:28,809 --> 01:27:33,678
In time, you will call me master.

738
01:27:33,809 --> 01:27:36,164
You're gravely mistaken.

739
01:27:36,289 --> 01:27:38,325
You won't convert me
as you did my father.

740
01:27:39,169 --> 01:27:42,764
Oh, no, my young Jedi.

741
01:27:44,809 --> 01:27:48,722
You will find that
it is you who are mistaken...

742
01:27:50,089 --> 01:27:54,048
about a great many things.

743
01:27:55,689 --> 01:27:57,247
His lightsabre.

744
01:27:57,369 --> 01:28:00,884
Ah, yes. AJedi's weapon.

745
01:28:01,649 --> 01:28:03,958
Much like your father's.

746
01:28:04,089 --> 01:28:08,685
By now you must know your father
can never be turned from the dark side.

747
01:28:08,809 --> 01:28:11,528
So will it be with you.

748
01:28:11,649 --> 01:28:13,605
You're wrong.

749
01:28:13,729 --> 01:28:16,687
Soon I'll be dead-
and you with me.

750
01:28:20,009 --> 01:28:24,127
Perhaps you refer to
the imminent attack of your rebel fleet.

751
01:28:24,929 --> 01:28:26,282
Yes.

752
01:28:26,409 --> 01:28:31,324
I assure you we are quite safe
from your friends here.

753
01:28:32,449 --> 01:28:35,202
Your overconfidence
is your weakness.

754
01:28:35,329 --> 01:28:38,321
Your faith in your friends is yours.

755
01:28:40,769 --> 01:28:44,205
It is pointless to resist, my son.

756
01:28:48,089 --> 01:28:53,322
Everything that has transpired
has done so according to my design.

757
01:28:53,449 --> 01:28:56,521
Your friends up there
on the sanctuary moon...

758
01:28:56,649 --> 01:29:00,801
are walking into a trap,
as is your rebel fleet.

759
01:29:02,649 --> 01:29:05,038
It was I who allowed the Alliance...

760
01:29:05,169 --> 01:29:08,445
to know the location
of the shield generator.

761
01:29:08,569 --> 01:29:12,448
It is quite safe
from your pitiful little band.

762
01:29:12,569 --> 01:29:16,642
An entire legion
of my best troops awaits them.

763
01:29:19,049 --> 01:29:22,644
I'm afraid the deflector shield...

764
01:29:22,769 --> 01:29:27,763
will be quite operational
when your friends arrive.

765
01:29:31,169 --> 01:29:32,443
All right!

766
01:29:32,569 --> 01:29:34,002
Up! Move!

767
01:29:34,129 --> 01:29:35,528
Quickly. Quickly.

768
01:29:39,849 --> 01:29:41,407
Han, hurry.

769
01:29:41,529 --> 01:29:43,326
The fleet will be here any moment.

770
01:29:44,969 --> 01:29:47,119
Charges. Come on. Come on!

771
01:29:49,169 --> 01:29:50,921
Oh, my. They'll be captured.

772
01:29:53,689 --> 01:29:55,327
Wait! Come back!

773
01:29:57,729 --> 01:29:59,447
R2, stay with me.

774
01:30:00,449 --> 01:30:02,007
Freeze!

775
01:30:05,249 --> 01:30:07,126
You rebel scum.

776
01:30:26,009 --> 01:30:29,240
- All wings report in.
- Red Leader standing by.

777
01:30:29,369 --> 01:30:32,406
- Grey Leader standing by.
- Green Leader standing by.

778
01:30:33,249 --> 01:30:35,285
Lock S-foils in attack positions.

779
01:30:38,809 --> 01:30:40,845
May the Force be with us.

780
01:30:44,289 --> 01:30:47,167
We've gotta be able to get
a reading on that shield- up or down.

781
01:30:48,769 --> 01:30:51,329
How could they be jamming us
if they don't know-

782
01:30:52,329 --> 01:30:53,842
if we're coming.

783
01:30:53,969 --> 01:30:57,325
Break off the attack.
The shield is still up.

784
01:30:57,449 --> 01:30:59,440
I get no reading. You sure?

785
01:30:59,569 --> 01:31:01,639
<i>Pull up! All craft pull up!</i>

786
01:31:05,969 --> 01:31:09,757
Take evasive action. Green Group,
stick close to Holding Sector MV-7.

787
01:31:11,529 --> 01:31:14,168
Admiral, we have
enemy ships in Sector 47.

788
01:31:14,289 --> 01:31:15,722
It's a trap.

789
01:31:19,169 --> 01:31:21,046
Fighters coming in.

790
01:31:24,369 --> 01:31:25,643
There's too many.

791
01:31:28,849 --> 01:31:32,080
Accelerate to attack speed.
Draw their fire away from the cruisers.

792
01:31:32,209 --> 01:31:33,198
Copy, Gold Leader.

793
01:31:36,489 --> 01:31:37,922
Come, boy.

794
01:31:38,769 --> 01:31:40,646
See for yourself.

795
01:31:43,209 --> 01:31:48,203
From here, you will witness
the final destruction of the Alliance...

796
01:31:48,329 --> 01:31:52,004
and the end
of your insignificant rebellion.

797
01:31:57,049 --> 01:31:59,279
You want this...

798
01:32:00,049 --> 01:32:01,846
don't you?

799
01:32:01,969 --> 01:32:06,281
The hate is swelling in you now.

800
01:32:07,049 --> 01:32:09,119
Take your Jedi weapon.

801
01:32:09,249 --> 01:32:10,921
Use it.

802
01:32:11,049 --> 01:32:12,926
I am unarmed.

803
01:32:13,049 --> 01:32:14,846
Strike me down with it.

804
01:32:14,969 --> 01:32:17,403
Give in to your anger.

805
01:32:18,409 --> 01:32:23,324
<i>With each passing moment
you make yourself more my servant.</i>

806
01:32:29,649 --> 01:32:31,605
It is unavoidable.

807
01:32:32,649 --> 01:32:34,685
It is your destiny.

808
01:32:35,689 --> 01:32:38,681
You, like your father...

809
01:32:38,809 --> 01:32:40,367
are now...

810
01:32:41,249 --> 01:32:42,807
mine.

811
01:33:00,209 --> 01:33:02,439
All right, move it.

812
01:33:10,129 --> 01:33:11,687
Hello. I say, over there.

813
01:33:12,609 --> 01:33:14,679
Were you looking for me?

814
01:33:15,969 --> 01:33:17,925
Bring those two down here.

815
01:33:25,249 --> 01:33:29,367
They're on their way.
R2, are you sure this was a good idea?

816
01:33:29,489 --> 01:33:30,763
Freeze.

817
01:33:30,889 --> 01:33:31,958
Don't move.

818
01:33:32,089 --> 01:33:33,920
We surrender.

819
01:35:34,449 --> 01:35:36,246
The code's changed.

820
01:35:36,369 --> 01:35:38,644
- We need R2.
- Here's the terminal.

821
01:35:38,769 --> 01:35:40,680
R2, where are you?

822
01:35:40,809 --> 01:35:42,686
We need you at the bunker
right away.

823
01:35:44,689 --> 01:35:46,122
Going? What do you mean?

824
01:35:47,769 --> 01:35:49,327
Going where, R2?

825
01:35:49,449 --> 01:35:53,488
Wait. R2, this is
no time for heroics.

826
01:35:53,609 --> 01:35:55,201
Come back!

827
01:36:20,369 --> 01:36:22,087
Watch yourself, Wedge.
Three from above.

828
01:36:22,209 --> 01:36:25,007
- Red Three, Red Two, pull in.
- Got it.

829
01:36:28,129 --> 01:36:29,801
Three of them coming in, 20 degrees.

830
01:36:29,929 --> 01:36:31,567
Cut left.
I'll take the leader.

831
01:36:39,569 --> 01:36:41,241
They're heading
for the medical frigate.

832
01:36:46,049 --> 01:36:47,198
Pressure's steady.

833
01:36:56,009 --> 01:36:59,160
Only the fighters are attacking.
What are the Stardestroyers waiting for?

834
01:37:03,609 --> 01:37:05,247
We're in attack position, sir.

835
01:37:05,369 --> 01:37:08,406
- Hold here.
- We're not going to attack?

836
01:37:08,529 --> 01:37:11,680
My orders are from the emperor himself.
He has something special planned.

837
01:37:11,809 --> 01:37:13,640
We only need to
keep them from escaping.

838
01:37:15,289 --> 01:37:19,202
As you can see,
my young apprentice...

839
01:37:19,329 --> 01:37:22,446
<i>your friends have failed.</i>

840
01:37:23,209 --> 01:37:25,484
Now witness the firepower...

841
01:37:25,609 --> 01:37:30,729
of this fully armed
and operational battle station.

842
01:37:31,849 --> 01:37:34,283
Fire at will, Commander.

843
01:37:41,009 --> 01:37:42,647
Fire.

844
01:37:49,009 --> 01:37:51,443
That blast came from the Death Star.

845
01:37:52,369 --> 01:37:54,599
That thing's operational.

846
01:37:54,729 --> 01:37:56,481
Home 1, this is Gold Leader.

847
01:37:56,609 --> 01:37:58,600
We saw it.
All craft prepare to retreat.

848
01:37:58,729 --> 01:38:00,845
You won't get
another chance at this, Admiral.

849
01:38:00,969 --> 01:38:03,608
We have no choice, General Calrissian.

850
01:38:03,729 --> 01:38:06,880
Our cruisers can't repel
firepower of that magnitude.

851
01:38:07,009 --> 01:38:10,558
Han will have that shield down.
We've gotta give him more time.

852
01:38:28,609 --> 01:38:29,962
We're coming.

853
01:38:35,609 --> 01:38:36,883
Come on.

854
01:38:40,529 --> 01:38:41,848
R2, hurry!

855
01:38:47,649 --> 01:38:48,559
My goodness!

856
01:38:54,409 --> 01:38:56,320
Why did you have to be so brave?

857
01:38:59,369 --> 01:39:01,803
Well, I suppose I could
hot-wire this thing.

858
01:39:01,929 --> 01:39:03,328
I'll cover you.

859
01:39:43,209 --> 01:39:45,564
Yes, I said closer.
Move as close as you can...

860
01:39:45,689 --> 01:39:48,283
and engage those Stardestroyers
at point-blank range.

861
01:39:48,409 --> 01:39:51,685
At that close range, we won't last long
against those Stardestroyers.

862
01:39:51,809 --> 01:39:54,323
We'll last longer than we will
against that Death Star...

863
01:39:54,449 --> 01:39:56,599
and we might
take a few of them with us.

864
01:39:59,409 --> 01:40:00,683
She's gonna blow!

865
01:40:04,609 --> 01:40:06,122
I'm hit!

866
01:40:11,089 --> 01:40:13,159
Your fleet is lost...

867
01:40:13,289 --> 01:40:17,168
and your friends on the Endor moon
will not survive.

868
01:40:19,369 --> 01:40:21,678
There is no escape...

869
01:40:21,809 --> 01:40:24,323
my young apprentice.

870
01:40:26,449 --> 01:40:28,804
The Alliance will die...

871
01:40:30,609 --> 01:40:33,328
as will your friends.

872
01:40:36,809 --> 01:40:38,037
Good.

873
01:40:39,009 --> 01:40:42,126
I can feel your anger.

874
01:40:43,809 --> 01:40:47,165
I am defenceless.
Take your weapon.

875
01:40:47,289 --> 01:40:50,281
Strike me down
with all of your hatred...

876
01:40:50,409 --> 01:40:54,721
and your journey towards
the dark side will be complete.

877
01:41:32,409 --> 01:41:34,365
- Look!
- Get him off of there.

878
01:43:22,889 --> 01:43:24,800
I think I got it.

879
01:43:24,929 --> 01:43:26,123
I got it!

880
01:43:33,129 --> 01:43:34,357
Are you all right?

881
01:43:34,489 --> 01:43:36,286
- Let's see.
- It's not bad.

882
01:43:36,409 --> 01:43:37,637
- Freeze!
- Oh, dear.

883
01:43:37,769 --> 01:43:39,202
Don't move.

884
01:43:43,489 --> 01:43:46,083
- I love you.
- I know.

885
01:43:46,209 --> 01:43:47,483
Hands up.

886
01:43:48,569 --> 01:43:49,718
Stand up.

887
01:43:59,169 --> 01:44:00,568
Stay back.

888
01:44:08,169 --> 01:44:10,763
Get down here.
She's wounded.

889
01:44:10,889 --> 01:44:12,641
No, wait.

890
01:44:12,769 --> 01:44:14,282
I got an idea.

891
01:44:25,129 --> 01:44:26,562
Good.

892
01:44:26,689 --> 01:44:30,318
Use your aggressive feelings, boy.

893
01:44:30,449 --> 01:44:33,043
Let the hate flow through you.

894
01:44:38,489 --> 01:44:41,925
Obi-Wan has taught you well.

895
01:44:45,249 --> 01:44:47,524
I will not fight you, Father.

896
01:45:01,049 --> 01:45:03,722
You are unwise
to lower your defences.

897
01:45:27,649 --> 01:45:29,958
Your thoughts betray you, Father.

898
01:45:30,089 --> 01:45:33,081
I feel the good in you, the conflict.

899
01:45:33,209 --> 01:45:35,564
There is no conflict.

900
01:45:37,849 --> 01:45:39,726
You couldn't bring yourself
to kill me before...

901
01:45:39,849 --> 01:45:41,726
<i>and I don't believe
you'll destroy me now.</i>

902
01:45:41,849 --> 01:45:46,206
You underestimate
the power of the dark side.

903
01:45:46,329 --> 01:45:48,081
If you will not fight...

904
01:45:48,209 --> 01:45:50,677
then you will meet your destiny.

905
01:46:01,689 --> 01:46:02,838
Good.

906
01:46:02,969 --> 01:46:04,322
Good.

907
01:46:12,649 --> 01:46:16,119
- Watch out. Squad at.06.
- I'm on it, Gold Leader.

908
01:46:17,969 --> 01:46:19,322
Good shot, Red Two.

909
01:46:22,809 --> 01:46:25,767
We're sure in the middle of it now.
Come on, Han, old buddy.

910
01:46:25,889 --> 01:46:27,481
Don't let me down.

911
01:46:31,849 --> 01:46:33,248
<i>It's over, Commander.</i>

912
01:46:33,369 --> 01:46:35,599
<i>The rebels have been routed.
They're fleeing.</i>

913
01:46:35,729 --> 01:46:38,163
<i>We need reinforcements
to continue the pursuit.</i>

914
01:46:39,209 --> 01:46:41,086
Send three squads to help.

915
01:46:41,209 --> 01:46:43,086
- Open the back door.
- Sir.

916
01:46:56,689 --> 01:46:58,042
Throw me another charge.

917
01:47:14,889 --> 01:47:17,562
You cannot hide forever, Luke.

918
01:47:18,769 --> 01:47:20,600
I will not fight you.

919
01:47:23,969 --> 01:47:26,881
Give yourself to the dark side.

920
01:47:28,409 --> 01:47:32,288
<i>It is the only way
you can save your friends.</i>

921
01:47:33,289 --> 01:47:34,927
Yes.

922
01:47:35,049 --> 01:47:36,926
Your thoughts betray you.

923
01:47:37,049 --> 01:47:39,483
Your feelings for them are strong...

924
01:47:39,609 --> 01:47:41,406
especially for...

925
01:47:43,489 --> 01:47:45,081
sister.

926
01:47:46,289 --> 01:47:50,441
So you have a twin sister.

927
01:47:50,569 --> 01:47:54,118
Your feelings have now
betrayed her too.

928
01:47:54,249 --> 01:47:58,162
Obi-Wan was wise
to hide her from me.

929
01:47:58,289 --> 01:48:02,487
Now his failure is complete.

930
01:48:03,929 --> 01:48:07,558
If you will not turn
to the dark side...

931
01:48:07,689 --> 01:48:10,362
then perhaps she will.

932
01:48:10,489 --> 01:48:11,365
Never!

933
01:48:55,129 --> 01:48:56,767
Good!

934
01:49:00,929 --> 01:49:03,523
Your hate has made you powerful.

935
01:49:04,769 --> 01:49:09,445
Now, fulfil your destiny...

936
01:49:09,569 --> 01:49:13,482
and take your father's place at my side.

937
01:49:27,929 --> 01:49:29,203
Never.

938
01:49:32,129 --> 01:49:34,199
I'll never turn to the dark side.

939
01:49:37,049 --> 01:49:39,768
You've failed, Your Highness.

940
01:49:39,889 --> 01:49:41,766
I am a Jedi...

941
01:49:41,889 --> 01:49:43,845
like my father before me.

942
01:49:51,129 --> 01:49:54,439
So be it,Jedi.

943
01:49:54,649 --> 01:49:56,446
Move! Move!

944
01:50:08,569 --> 01:50:12,278
The shield is down. Commence attack
on the Death Star's main reactor.

945
01:50:12,409 --> 01:50:16,004
We're on our way. Red Group,
Gold Group, all fighters follow me.

946
01:50:16,129 --> 01:50:17,960
I told you they'd do it.

947
01:50:24,809 --> 01:50:27,323
If you will not be turned...

948
01:50:27,449 --> 01:50:30,646
<i>you will be destroyed.</i>

949
01:50:37,529 --> 01:50:39,042
Young fool.

950
01:50:40,089 --> 01:50:42,683
Only now, at the end...

951
01:50:42,809 --> 01:50:44,606
do you understand.

952
01:50:57,289 --> 01:51:02,807
Your feeble skills are no match
for the power of the dark side.

953
01:51:06,489 --> 01:51:10,164
You have paid the price
for your lack of vision.

954
01:51:15,529 --> 01:51:17,281
Father, please!

955
01:51:31,969 --> 01:51:34,039
Now, young Skywalker...

956
01:51:36,089 --> 01:51:37,841
<i>you will die.</i>

957
01:52:57,209 --> 01:52:58,608
I'm going in.

958
01:53:01,649 --> 01:53:02,798
Here goes nothing.

959
01:53:09,609 --> 01:53:13,318
Lock onto the strongest power source.
It should be the power generator.

960
01:53:15,449 --> 01:53:18,759
Form up. Stay alert.
We could run out of space real fast.

961
01:53:33,809 --> 01:53:35,720
Split up and head back to the surface.

962
01:53:35,849 --> 01:53:38,886
See if you can get a few
of those TIE fighters to follow you.

963
01:53:39,009 --> 01:53:39,919
Copy, Gold Leader.

964
01:53:49,809 --> 01:53:51,322
That was too close.

965
01:53:55,169 --> 01:53:57,239
We've got to give
those fighters more time.

966
01:53:57,369 --> 01:54:00,281
Concentrate all fire
on that Super Stardestroyer.

967
01:54:06,169 --> 01:54:08,205
Sir, we've lost our
bridge deflector shields.

968
01:54:08,329 --> 01:54:11,207
Intensify the forward batteries.
I don't want anything to get through.

969
01:54:13,609 --> 01:54:15,281
Intensify forward firepower!

970
01:54:17,049 --> 01:54:18,198
Too late!

971
01:55:01,449 --> 01:55:05,158
Help me take this mask off.

972
01:55:05,289 --> 01:55:07,086
But you'll die.

973
01:55:07,929 --> 01:55:11,285
Nothing can stop that now.

974
01:55:12,329 --> 01:55:13,887
Just for once...

975
01:55:14,809 --> 01:55:16,367
let me...

976
01:55:16,489 --> 01:55:19,799
look on you with my own eyes.

977
01:55:54,569 --> 01:55:58,767
Now go, my son.

978
01:56:00,409 --> 01:56:01,762
Leave me.

979
01:56:02,809 --> 01:56:05,164
No. You're coming with me.

980
01:56:05,289 --> 01:56:07,519
I'll not leave you here.
I've got to save you.

981
01:56:08,369 --> 01:56:11,918
You already have, Luke.

982
01:56:13,049 --> 01:56:14,846
You were right.

983
01:56:15,609 --> 01:56:17,839
You were right about me.

984
01:56:19,689 --> 01:56:21,407
Tell your sister...

985
01:56:22,409 --> 01:56:24,525
<i>you were right.</i>

986
01:56:31,329 --> 01:56:32,364
Father.

987
01:56:36,529 --> 01:56:37,803
I won't leave you.

988
01:57:02,209 --> 01:57:03,164
There it is.

989
01:57:06,009 --> 01:57:08,284
Wedge, go for the power regulator
on the north tower.

990
01:57:08,409 --> 01:57:11,560
Copy, Gold Leader.
I'm already on my way out.

991
01:57:30,009 --> 01:57:33,001
Move the fleet
away from the Death Star.

992
01:58:18,289 --> 01:58:19,881
They did it!

993
01:58:28,009 --> 01:58:30,318
I'm sure Luke wasn't
on that thing when it blew.

994
01:58:32,009 --> 01:58:33,761
He wasn't.

995
01:58:33,889 --> 01:58:35,481
I can feel it.

996
01:58:39,969 --> 01:58:41,482
You love him.

997
01:58:44,769 --> 01:58:46,122
Don't you?

998
01:58:46,249 --> 01:58:47,648
Yes.

999
01:58:47,769 --> 01:58:50,363
All right. I understand.

1000
01:58:50,489 --> 01:58:51,808
Fine.

1001
01:58:52,809 --> 01:58:54,527
When he comes back...

1002
01:58:55,569 --> 01:58:57,241
I won't get in the way.

1003
01:58:59,849 --> 01:59:01,726
It's not like that at all.

1004
01:59:05,289 --> 01:59:07,519
He's my brother.

1005
02:00:44,969 --> 02:00:46,527
Wesa free!

